WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.900
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:44.660 --> 01:47.620
Kaitou Jeanne! I won't forgive you!

02:00.890 --> 02:03.770
My...My treasure!

02:03.770 --> 02:07.020
I won't let you take it from me!

02:07.020 --> 02:09.690
Sir! Please calm down!

02:09.690 --> 02:12.820
We will protect your valuables!

02:12.820 --> 02:14.780
My turtle! My turtle!

02:14.780 --> 02:16.860
It's mine!

02:21.660 --> 02:23.660
Miyako, what are you doing?

02:23.660 --> 02:26.000
It's a tool to capture Jeanne.

02:26.000 --> 02:29.000
I haven't been doing gymnastics for nothing.

02:29.330 --> 02:35.960
Dive! The Death of the Double Kaitou

02:51.440 --> 02:52.980
Too many security guards.

02:52.980 --> 02:54.900
Cheer up, Maron!

02:54.900 --> 02:58.780
The Demon is the sea turtle made of shells.

02:58.780 --> 03:00.280
I know.

03:00.280 --> 03:04.530
Anyway Fin, don't forget to drop the rope after I seal the Demon.

03:04.530 --> 03:06.620
I know.

03:06.620 --> 03:08.580
Oh, Fin.

03:08.580 --> 03:09.750
Be careful.

03:09.750 --> 03:11.750
Yeah. Let's go, Fin!

03:11.750 --> 03:12.750
Okay.

03:23.850 --> 03:26.140
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

03:37.020 --> 03:39.030
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

03:39.030 --> 03:40.650
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

03:40.650 --> 03:42.410
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

03:46.240 --> 03:47.410
<i>Game Start!</i>

03:50.460 --> 03:51.750
It's Jeanne!

03:51.750 --> 03:52.670
Leave this to me!

04:05.680 --> 04:06.850
Damn!

04:06.850 --> 04:09.470
Jeanne is on the gondola now.

04:09.470 --> 04:11.560
Anyway, she's pretty reckless.

04:12.270 --> 04:13.980
The only way out is through here.

04:13.980 --> 04:16.360
How is she going to escape?

04:16.360 --> 04:17.980
Yeah...

04:22.530 --> 04:26.530
As soon as the gondola comes to a halt, shoot the gas bombs inside!

04:26.530 --> 04:27.780
Roger.

04:27.780 --> 04:28.580
Fire!

04:38.750 --> 04:40.550
There's no one here!

04:40.550 --> 04:42.630
Up there!

04:54.850 --> 04:57.270
You've done well as always.

05:01.570 --> 05:04.030
But this is it. Give it up!

05:11.700 --> 05:13.000
Damn!

05:28.220 --> 05:29.640
The Demon's not here!

05:29.640 --> 05:31.390
Miyako must have hidden it!

05:31.390 --> 05:34.680
Petit Claire, show me where the Demon is!

05:42.860 --> 05:43.780
There!

05:49.240 --> 05:50.280
This way...

05:52.950 --> 05:58.170
My...My turtle! I won't let anyone have it!

06:01.340 --> 06:02.550
That must be it!

06:05.920 --> 06:07.800
In the name of God...

06:07.800 --> 06:10.180
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

06:10.180 --> 06:11.970
I seal you here!

06:11.970 --> 06:13.760
<i>Checkmate!</i>

06:30.240 --> 06:31.700
<i>Collection completed!</i>

06:33.240 --> 06:35.540
What was I doing?!

06:39.830 --> 06:44.750
Kaitou Jeanne! Stay here and face the consequences!

06:44.750 --> 06:46.050
Fin, the rope!

06:46.050 --> 06:48.800
It's all ready to go. Go quickly!

06:52.430 --> 06:55.890
Something's odd. There's no one here.

07:00.520 --> 07:03.270
I was waiting for you, Kaitou Jeanne.

07:05.730 --> 07:10.490
The only way out now is through that gondola.

07:10.490 --> 07:15.030
There's no way for you to escape through there...

07:15.030 --> 07:18.790
So I knew you would have another escape route planned.

07:20.000 --> 07:24.540
This route is a dead end now. You cannot escape.

07:29.130 --> 07:32.680
In front of you is the sea and behind you is a cliff.

07:33.720 --> 07:36.720
So, how are you going to escape from here?

07:37.640 --> 07:38.680
Jeanne!

07:44.480 --> 07:45.400
Fire!

07:47.730 --> 07:48.730
She got away!

07:48.730 --> 07:49.530
Jeanne got away!

07:49.530 --> 07:51.030
Get her! Get her!

08:17.560 --> 08:19.140
I won't let you get away!

08:28.400 --> 08:30.570
What?! What should I do?!

08:37.660 --> 08:40.620
Jeanne! Jeanne...

08:40.620 --> 08:42.620
This is the end of Jeanne.

08:42.620 --> 08:44.040
Looks like it...

08:44.040 --> 08:48.920
Although she made us struggle, I kinda feel bad for her.

08:48.920 --> 08:54.470
She can't be dead...because...I have yet to catch her.

09:01.310 --> 09:03.890
Notice

09:01.310 --> 09:03.890
Don't go away!

09:01.310 --> 09:03.890
I'll return right after these messages!

09:01.310 --> 09:03.890
Kaitou Jeanne

09:04.890 --> 09:07.480
Notice

09:04.890 --> 09:07.480
I'm back to continue my adventures

09:04.890 --> 09:07.480
Kaitou Jeanne

09:17.660 --> 09:20.790
Jumping from such a high place was reckless!

09:20.790 --> 09:23.580
But...I'm glad you're safe.

09:25.160 --> 09:27.580
Maron! I heard you caught a cold!

09:28.460 --> 09:29.090
Miyako!

09:29.090 --> 09:31.380
Are you okay, Kusakabe-san?

09:31.380 --> 09:32.050
Yo!

09:34.380 --> 09:37.050
You all came to see me?

09:38.590 --> 09:44.100
You have such bad sleeping habits, I assumed you kicked your blankets off and caught a cold!

09:47.690 --> 09:49.770
What's wrong, Class President?

09:49.770 --> 09:52.400
I heard summer colds are tough...

09:52.400 --> 09:54.070
Please take care, okay?

09:54.070 --> 09:57.400
Class President you're so nice, unlike someone else I know...

09:57.400 --> 09:58.490
Thanks!

09:58.490 --> 10:00.030
Oh, it's nothing.

10:00.030 --> 10:05.870
Hey Maron, Kaitou Jeanne escaped when I was so close to catching her.

10:05.870 --> 10:08.040
That's too bad.

10:08.040 --> 10:10.000
She fell into the ocean.

10:10.000 --> 10:11.630
Did she die?

10:11.630 --> 10:13.590
It's Kaitou Jeanne we're talking about.

10:13.590 --> 10:15.590
I'm sure she can swim.

10:15.590 --> 10:18.300
But she fell from so high up.

10:18.300 --> 10:20.760
Hey Miyako, are you worried about her?

10:20.760 --> 10:25.180
No way! I wanted to arrest Jeanne myself.

10:25.180 --> 10:28.980
If she doesn't reappear after this, I'll feel cheated forever!

10:30.350 --> 10:33.110
Is that so?

10:34.280 --> 10:36.780
What is it? Don't stare at me!

10:36.780 --> 10:39.360
You see, I was just thinking about the great view!

10:40.610 --> 10:42.870
Hey, don't look you pervert!

10:42.870 --> 10:46.330
Don't come here if that's all you're gonna do!

10:46.330 --> 10:48.500
I couldn't help but notice.

10:48.500 --> 10:50.210
You're the worst!

10:50.210 --> 10:53.210
Flirting again? Don't you guys ever get tired of it?

10:53.210 --> 10:54.710
Let's go!

10:54.710 --> 10:58.800
I'm sure you don't want to be subjected to all this noise, don't you, Class President?

11:00.300 --> 11:01.720
What was that about?

11:01.720 --> 11:03.800
Haven't got a clue, do you?

11:03.800 --> 11:05.310
Huh?

11:06.310 --> 11:08.180
Chiaki, why do you always...

11:09.350 --> 11:12.730
...say things to girls that embarrass them?

11:12.730 --> 11:14.230
It's my nature.

11:14.230 --> 11:16.030
Then do something about it!

11:16.030 --> 11:17.570
I can't!

11:17.570 --> 11:21.030
It's not that easy to change one's nature.

11:21.030 --> 11:24.030
You always change subjects like this.

11:24.030 --> 11:24.830
Yes?

11:28.120 --> 11:30.330
How are you feeling, Kusakabe-san?

11:30.330 --> 11:31.620
Chiaki-kun?

11:31.620 --> 11:35.000
Oh Maron-chan, you're a friend of Chiaki-kun?

11:35.000 --> 11:36.840
Huh? Why do you ask?

11:36.840 --> 11:40.550
The owner of this hospital is Chiaki-kun's father.

11:40.550 --> 11:41.760
Really?

11:41.760 --> 11:43.220
Seems like it.

11:43.220 --> 11:47.310
Since you're Chiaki-san's friend, I'll give you a special service.

11:47.310 --> 11:48.520
A Special service?

11:48.520 --> 11:52.650
Yes, a big shot that's really effective against colds.

11:52.980 --> 11:57.730
I don't want a big shot!!!

11:57.730 --> 11:59.400
I was just kidding.

11:59.400 --> 12:02.530
Since you're this energetic, you should be all right.

12:12.460 --> 12:15.670
The nurses are all so beautiful.

12:15.670 --> 12:18.920
All the doctors are handsome, too.

12:18.920 --> 12:24.680
Yeah, there are only cool doctors and pretty nurses at this hospital.

12:24.680 --> 12:26.010
It's so surprising!

12:26.010 --> 12:28.350
My old man selects them.

12:28.350 --> 12:32.560
But they're all competent doctors and nurses.

12:38.520 --> 12:39.530
Chiaki...

12:51.330 --> 12:53.870
Chiaki-sama! Jumping out like that is dangerous!

12:53.870 --> 12:56.920
Kagura! Who is that woman with my old man?!

12:56.920 --> 12:59.920
She's his fifth wife.

12:59.920 --> 13:01.510
He got divorced again?!

13:03.220 --> 13:05.220
Kagura, what's the delay?

13:05.220 --> 13:06.640
I'll go right away.

13:06.640 --> 13:09.720
Chiaki-kun, get in the car if you have something to say.

13:09.720 --> 13:12.930
Why the hell would I get in your car?

13:12.930 --> 13:14.520
Get going.

13:28.740 --> 13:33.540
Maron, you sure are sighing a lot. What's on your mind?

13:33.540 --> 13:37.080
Why can't Chiaki and his father get along?

13:37.080 --> 13:41.710
That's not something that should concern you, Maron.

13:41.710 --> 13:43.590
What?! I'm worried!

13:43.590 --> 13:47.300
Worrying won't do you any good.

13:47.300 --> 13:50.010
You sure are a worrywart.

13:50.010 --> 13:55.600
Geez, Fin! You'll never understand these family issues!

13:56.390 --> 14:02.400
<i>Maron-chan, it's Mom. I'm sorry, but we've decided to get a divorce.</i>

14:03.530 --> 14:06.150
He got divorced again?!

14:07.030 --> 14:08.110
Chiaki, too...

14:10.780 --> 14:13.620
You've recovered from your illness rather quickly.

14:13.620 --> 14:14.540
You're...

14:16.540 --> 14:19.170
I'm Kagura, secretary to the president of this hospital.

14:19.170 --> 14:21.380
He asked me to relay a message.

14:22.380 --> 14:25.630
He wants to talk about Chiaki-sama.

14:25.630 --> 14:26.760
About Chiaki?

14:26.760 --> 14:30.800
He'd like you to meet with him at his house.

14:40.310 --> 14:44.320
Chiaki doesn't seem to want to return home.

14:44.320 --> 14:48.320
Could you please try to persuade him to come back again?

14:48.320 --> 14:50.360
Of course I'll try...

14:50.360 --> 14:53.370
...but I don't think he'll listen.

14:53.370 --> 14:58.870
Maron-chan, you're so cute that I'm sure he'll listen to you.

14:58.870 --> 15:00.370
Not really...

15:01.670 --> 15:03.460
It's my hobby.

15:03.460 --> 15:05.090
They're beautiful, aren't they?

15:05.090 --> 15:10.590
Flying from flower to flower, these butterflies seem like tiny angels to me.

15:10.590 --> 15:13.260
If possible, I'd like to keep them alive.

15:13.260 --> 15:15.560
But their life span is very short.

15:15.560 --> 15:21.060
Oh yeah, I've recently found something as beautiful as these butterflies.

15:29.400 --> 15:30.820
This is...!

15:30.820 --> 15:32.530
It's beautiful, isn't it?

15:32.530 --> 15:34.660
Where did you get this picture?

15:35.870 --> 15:39.660
A photographer friend got a chance to take this picture.

15:39.660 --> 15:46.380
It might be rather strange to have a picture of a fugitive thief.

15:47.590 --> 15:50.800
Her appearance bathed in moonlight is quite stunning.

15:50.800 --> 15:54.050
Almost like a butterfly.

15:55.430 --> 15:57.510
Kagura? What is it?

15:57.510 --> 16:00.600
<i>A rare butterfly has arrived from abroad.</i>

16:00.600 --> 16:01.940
<i>Do you want to come and take a look?</i>

16:01.940 --> 16:03.440
I'll come see it right away.

16:04.560 --> 16:07.320
A rare butterfly has arrived from overseas.

16:07.320 --> 16:08.440
Would you like to come, too?

16:08.440 --> 16:10.280
No thanks, another time.

16:10.280 --> 16:12.240
Anyway, please take care of Chiaki.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.740
I will!

16:21.710 --> 16:23.670
Please come out to the balcony tonight.

16:21.710 --> 16:23.670
Maron

16:24.500 --> 16:25.630
What?

16:29.050 --> 16:32.170
Of all things, you want to talk to me about my dad?

16:32.170 --> 16:33.550
Did he put you up to this?

16:33.550 --> 16:39.140
Yeah, but I do want you and your father to be a normal family.

16:39.140 --> 16:40.680
Don't bother.

16:40.680 --> 16:43.350
I envy you, Chiaki.

16:44.940 --> 16:48.900
Your father is very worried about you.

16:50.440 --> 16:52.860
Compared to that, I'm..

16:52.860 --> 16:56.570
It's a lot better not to have any contact with your parents.

16:56.570 --> 17:01.040
No way! Chiaki, you don't understand anything!

17:01.040 --> 17:02.580
My mother...

17:04.540 --> 17:06.330
She died when I was five.

17:08.420 --> 17:11.260
Since then, I've been...

17:14.010 --> 17:20.930
Dad! Why aren't you going to Mom?! Please, Dad!

17:20.930 --> 17:25.480
<i>She's sad being alone! Go to her! Dad!</i>

17:26.350 --> 17:30.650
<i>Chiaki, please take care of your father.</i>

17:35.780 --> 17:37.820
<i>Mom!!!</i>

17:41.080 --> 17:45.210
I hate you, Dad!

17:45.370 --> 17:49.500
People go away, no matter how much you love them.

17:50.670 --> 17:52.710
They'll disappear from your side.

17:52.710 --> 17:55.220
It's better not to love them in the first place.

18:08.230 --> 18:14.320
The legendary butterfly, Blue Morpho... I've finally got you in my possession.

18:22.490 --> 18:29.250
<i>Yesterday, all the doctors and nurses suddenly disappeared from Nagoya Hospital.</i>

18:29.250 --> 18:31.210
<i>What's this about?!</i>

18:31.210 --> 18:33.210
<i>Do you know anything?!</i>

18:33.210 --> 18:35.340
<i>I don't know anything.</i>

18:35.340 --> 18:37.800
<i>Please tell us!</i>

18:39.010 --> 18:40.180
This is bad!

18:41.300 --> 18:42.680
Maron, did you see the news?!

18:42.680 --> 18:43.680
Yeah!

18:46.270 --> 18:47.350
What is it?

18:47.350 --> 18:48.850
Chiaki, there's trouble!

18:48.850 --> 18:52.610
The doctors at your father's hospital have all disappeared!

18:52.610 --> 18:55.860
I know but it has nothing to do with me.

18:58.570 --> 19:01.570
"I have kidnapped Nagoya Kaisei. Bring $500,000." - Kaitou Jeanne<i></i>

18:58.900 --> 19:01.570
Chiaki's father has been kidnapped?!

19:01.570 --> 19:04.740
Kaitou Jeanne! I knew she was still alive!

19:05.620 --> 19:07.620
Dad, we're in trouble!

19:07.620 --> 19:08.660
Oh yeah?

19:10.040 --> 19:11.630
He's nowhere to be found?!

19:11.630 --> 19:14.170
Kagura, did you search everywhere?

19:14.170 --> 19:16.840
...Okay. If you find him, contact me right away!

19:17.840 --> 19:19.010
Any word?

19:20.010 --> 19:20.550
I knew it!

19:21.010 --> 19:27.770
According to Kagura, he disappeared after his statement to the news reporters.

19:27.770 --> 19:29.100
Dad!

19:29.100 --> 19:34.610
It's hard to believe he's actually been kidnapped, but we'll have to treat this seriously.

19:34.610 --> 19:35.770
Good morning!

19:35.770 --> 19:37.530
You guys are quick!

19:37.530 --> 19:39.650
I was shocked to get the report!

19:39.650 --> 19:42.570
I can't believe Kaitou Jeanne would kidnap anyone!

19:42.570 --> 19:44.570
It's not certain yet.

19:45.330 --> 19:49.450
I don't want to believe that Jeanne would do such a thing, either.

19:49.450 --> 19:52.710
But if it really was Jeanne, I won't forgive her!

19:53.710 --> 19:56.250
Chiaki, don't do anything on your own!

19:56.250 --> 19:58.210
Follow Dad's orders!

19:58.210 --> 19:59.010
Yes.

19:59.670 --> 20:03.010
Anyway, let's keep this away from the press.

20:03.010 --> 20:04.800
It'll be better that way.

20:04.800 --> 20:07.220
Put a trace on all calls to Chiaki-kun's room.

20:07.640 --> 20:08.640
Yes, sir!

20:09.180 --> 20:14.020
To use Jeanne's identity for evil deeds is the worst!

20:14.020 --> 20:19.730
I will punish the culprit who used Jeanne's name and prove her innocence!

20:21.900 --> 20:25.530
Who the hell is this guy, using Jeanne's name?!

20:25.530 --> 20:27.950
What are we gonna do, Sinbad?

20:27.950 --> 20:29.450
I can't let this slide!

20:29.450 --> 20:31.790
I will catch this guy with my bare hands!

20:35.830 --> 20:36.710
Yes?

20:36.710 --> 20:44.470
<i>Nagoya Chiaki, if you want your father back, come to the clock tower in Momokuri Park.</i>

20:44.470 --> 20:48.140
<i>If you notify the police, your father will die.</i>

20:49.510 --> 20:50.810
It's the kidnapper!

20:51.810 --> 20:55.230
I'll show him the powers of Kaitou Sinbad!

20:55.230 --> 20:57.980
Take him out, Sinbad!

20:57.980 --> 20:59.230
...Too heavy...

21:06.320 --> 21:09.030
What?! Maron?! Hey, Maron!

21:09.030 --> 21:09.620
What is it?

21:09.620 --> 21:10.660
Over there!

21:10.660 --> 21:12.120
Chiaki...

21:23.720 --> 21:25.720
He went to the clock tower in the park!

21:25.720 --> 21:26.430
Got it!

22:00.540 --> 22:04.970
CHIAKI!!!

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.590 --> 23:37.180
Fin! Chiaki's been... Chiaki's been shot! Then, he was taken away in a car...

23:37.180 --> 23:39.850
Maron! Maron, gather your energy!

23:39.850 --> 23:42.940
Energy? I'm...energetic.

23:42.940 --> 23:46.980
"Strong and serious... Energetic and..."

23:46.980 --> 23:49.150
Chiaki please, be okay!

23:49.150 --> 23:50.280
Maron...

23:50.280 --> 23:54.620
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: <i>Checkmate!</i> The Demon Butterfly, Blue Morpho!

23:55.490 --> 23:59.330
Chiaki, I will save you! <i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>
